# Built binaries (regenerate with `go build ./cmd/...` or `make`)
/canvas-pp-cli
/build/

# Go
*.test
*.out
coverage.*

# OS
.DS_Store

# Internal session handoff — kept locally, mirrored to ~/.claude/handoffs/
# Carries operational detail (hosts, account structure, local paths) that
# does not belong in a public repo.
HANDOFF.md

# One-off generator/verification reports — internal tooling output
dogfood-results.json
apify-actor-audit-report.json
workflow-verify-report.json

# Internal agent/process docs — kept locally, mirrored to
# ~/.claude/handoffs/canvas-pp-cli-docs/. Not for the public repo.
docs/

# Generator-era bookkeeping. Nothing reads these at runtime and the repo now
# ships standalone rather than tracking CLI Printing Press.
#
# .printing-press-patches/ is deliberately NOT ignored: AGENTS.md and CLAUDE.md
# both require recording hand-edits there so a reprint carries the intent
# forward, and an untracked record cannot survive a clone or reach a reviewer.
.printing-press*.json
manifest.json
tools-manifest.json
agentcookie.toml

# Contributor/agent notes — kept locally, mirrored to ~/.claude/handoffs/
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md

# Local build output (Makefile targets write here).
bin/
